                                                "sense_id": "959777ae-5245-3227-a165-26c064dcb950",
                                                "text": "Note that Stuart Grey makes the assertion: \"I think rationally on all subjects.\", and then proceeds to use the standard boiler tactics and phrases of the people WHO instigate conflict and war."
